<cap:headline>River Kamla Balan at Jhanjarpur in Madhubani district of Bihar continues to flow in above normal flood situation at 4:00 pm today.</cap:headline>
<cap:description>River Kamla Balan at Jhanjarpur in Madhubani district of Bihar continues to flow in above normal flood situation at 4:00 pm today. At 4:00 pm, it was flowing at a level of 49.8 m with falling trend which is 0.30 m above its Warning Level of 49.5 m and 0.70 m below its Danger Level of 50.5 m.</cap:description>
